  "id": "supported-employment",
  "term": "supported employment",
  "definition": "Supported employment is a vocational rehabilitation approach that helps people with severe mental illness get and keep jobs in ordinary community workplaces. It combines help with finding work and ongoing, individualised support, often coordinated with mental health or other services to support employment and wider social inclusion.",
